unts without presenting a partial load as complete.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-13\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-10\",\n     \"ASM-9\",\n     \"ASM-20\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The project-area content is available.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-14.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the proposed solution, architecture diagrams, app demonstration, testing and validation overview, challenges, production-readiness assessment, and go-to-market analysis.\",\n      \"when\": \"A user opens the project area.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The feedlot web app shall provide a project area presenting the proposed solution, architectural diagrams, an app demonstration, testing and validation overview, challenges, production-readiness assessment, and go-to-market analysis.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-14\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-11\",\n     \"ASM-10\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Two users with different role labels open the product areas.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screens show the same available views and controls for both users.\",\n      \"when\": \"They view operational records, cost and performance views, imports, and data-entry screens.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The feedlot web app shall make operational records, cost and performance views, imports, and data-entry functions available to all users without role-specific differences.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-15\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": []\n },\n {\n  \"draft\": \"d3\",\n  \"assumptions\": [\n   \"ASM-1 and ASM-11: procurement and receiving imports use supplied mock upstream data; no live connector is required.\",\n   \"ASM-2, ASM-12, ASM-13, and ASM-14: import issues are reported by row, unmatched records remain visibly pen